Source: openchamber
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/openchamber/openchamber

Package: openchamber
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set mapped from the RPM spec's soname Requires (bundled
# Electron runtime; t64 names target Debian Testing).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnspr4, libnss3, libuuid1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: Agentic development environment boards
 OpenChamber is an agentic development environment based on the OpenCode
 AI agent, with boards for issues and pull requests.
